msgid "Preset C (performance)"
msgstr "预设 C（性能）"

msgid ""
"The DLSS frame generation model preset.\n"
"Preset C is NVIDIA's lighter Frame Generation mode. It needs DLSS-G 310.9.16 or newer,\n"
"from the NVIDIA app's DLSS override; other providers keep the game / driver preset.\n"
"A change made while frame generation runs restarts it once, with a short pause;\n"
"some older DLSS-G versions apply it after a game restart."
msgstr ""
"DLSS 帧生成模型预设。\n"
"预设 C 是 NVIDIA 较轻量的帧生成模式，需要 DLSS-G 310.9.16 或更高版本，\n"
"可通过 NVIDIA App 的“DLSS 优设”获取；其他 DLSS-G 版本沿用游戏 / 驱动预设。\n"
"帧生成运行时更改会让帧生成重启一次，画面短暂停顿；\n"
"部分较旧的 DLSS-G 版本需重启游戏后生效。"

msgid "Preset %s is saved. It applies the next time frame generation starts, or after a game restart."
msgstr "预设 %s 已保存。将在下次启动帧生成时或重启游戏后生效。"

msgid "The game / driver preset is saved. It applies the next time frame generation starts, or after a game restart."
msgstr "游戏 / 驱动预设已保存。将在下次启动帧生成时或重启游戏后生效。"

msgid "Restarting frame generation with the new preset..."
msgstr "正在使用新预设重启帧生成…"

msgid "The game / driver preset is saved. Restart the game to use it."
msgstr "游戏 / 驱动预设已保存。重启游戏后生效。"

msgid "Preset %s is saved. Restart the game to use it."
msgstr "预设 %s 已保存。重启游戏后生效。"

