msgid ""
"Shows the original image left of the line and DLSS 5 to its right.\n"
"Before upscaling draws no line, because the upscaler would treat it as part of the image."
msgstr ""
"线左侧显示原始画面，右侧显示 DLSS 5。\n"
"放大前模式不绘制分隔线，因为放大器会把它当作画面的一部分。"

msgid "Split position"
msgstr "分隔位置"

msgid "Hold to show original"
msgstr "按住显示原始画面"

msgid ""
"While this key is held, the game shows its original image, so DLSS 5 can be compared in motion.\n"
"DLSS 5 keeps running, so its GPU cost is unchanged, and the key still reaches the game."
msgstr ""
"按住此键时，游戏显示原始画面，便于在运动中对比 DLSS 5。\n"
"DLSS 5 仍在运行，因此 GPU 开销不变，按键也仍会传给游戏。"

msgid "Presets"
msgstr "预设"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "%.1f ms"
msgstr "%.1f 毫秒"

msgid "%.0f%% of each rendered frame"
msgstr "占每个渲染帧的 %.0f%%"

msgid "GPU cost"
msgstr "GPU 开销"

msgid "every other frame, when the network runs"
msgstr "每隔一帧，网络运行时"

msgid "%.1f of %.1f ms"
msgstr "%.1f / %.1f 毫秒"

msgid "measuring"
msgstr "测量中"

msgid "Auto scale"
msgstr "自动比例"

msgid "%ux%u, network %ux%u, passes: %u"
msgstr "%ux%u，网络 %ux%u，处理次数：%u"

msgid "Route"
msgstr "路径"

msgid "Direct provider"
msgstr "直接提供程序"

msgid "Native NGX"
msgstr "原生 NGX"

msgid "DirectX 11 to DirectX 12"
msgstr "DirectX 11 到 DirectX 12"

msgid "Waiting for DLSS 5 GPU work to complete before applying settings."
msgstr "正在等待 DLSS 5 GPU 工作完成，然后应用设置。"

msgid "Auto Resolution Scale holds %.0f%%, its quality floor. DLSS 5 still costs more than its budget here, so the frame rate pays instead of detail."
msgstr "自动分辨率比例保持在 %.0f%%，即其画质下限。此处 DLSS 5 的开销仍超出预算，因此牺牲的是帧率而非细节。"

msgid "Auto Resolution Scale runs at %.0f%% of up to %.0f%% to keep DLSS 5 within its budget, and rises again with headroom."
msgstr "自动分辨率比例当前为 %.0f%%（最高 %.0f%%），以将 DLSS 5 控制在预算内；有余量时会再提高。"

msgid "Restart with other DLSS 5 add-ons disabled to give MFGUnlocker ownership of the provider."
msgstr "禁用其他 DLSS 5 附加组件后重启游戏，以便由 MFGUnlocker 管理提供程序。"

msgid "The Present stage does not run with XeMFG standalone. Choose Auto or an upscaling stage."
msgstr "独立 XeMFG 下“呈现”阶段不会运行。请选择“自动”或某个放大阶段。"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgid "Structure Intensity"
msgstr "结构强度"

msgid ""
"Local detail and structure enhancement.\n"
"Above 1 goes past the provider's usual range."
msgstr ""
"局部细节与结构增强。\n"
"高于 1 时超出提供程序的常规范围。"

msgid "Tone Intensity"
msgstr "色调强度"

msgid ""
"Local tone and contrast enhancement.\n"
"Above 1 goes past the provider's usual range."
msgstr ""
"局部色调与对比度增强。\n"
"高于 1 时超出提供程序的常规范围。"

msgid "Character Mask"
msgstr "角色遮罩"

msgid "Detects skin and faces so that Faces & skin applies to them."
msgstr "检测皮肤和面部，使“面部与皮肤”作用于它们。"

msgid "Look & passes"
msgstr "外观与多次处理"

msgid "Pass Count"
msgstr "处理次数"

msgid "Runs the network several times in a row. Every pass is a separate feature and costs GPU time and memory."
msgstr "连续多次运行网络。每次处理都是独立的功能实例，会占用 GPU 时间和显存。"

msgid "Same as pass 1"
msgstr "与第 1 次相同"

msgid "Later passes"
msgstr "后续处理"

msgid ""
"Passes 2 and later refine the previous pass's output. Custom gives them their own Style and strengths.\n"
"Tone adds up from pass to pass, so later passes usually want less of it."
msgstr ""
"第 2 次及之后的处理会细化上一次处理的输出。自定义可为它们设置单独的风格和强度。\n"
"色调会逐次叠加，因此后续处理通常需要更低的色调强度。"

msgid "Later-pass settings apply when Pass Count is 2 or more."
msgstr "处理次数为 2 或以上时，后续处理设置才会生效。"

msgid "Blend"
msgstr "混合"

msgid "Blend strength"
msgstr "混合强度"

msgid "Scales DLSS 5's change: 0 keeps the game's image, 1 is DLSS 5's result, above 1 exaggerates it."
msgstr "缩放 DLSS 5 的改动。设为 0 保留游戏画面，设为 1 为 DLSS 5 的结果，高于 1 会放大改动。"

msgid "Color strength"
msgstr "色彩强度"

msgid "0 keeps the game's colors and takes only DLSS 5's lighting and detail. 1 is DLSS 5's color; above 1 strengthens its color change."
msgstr "设为 0 保留游戏的色彩，只采用 DLSS 5 的光照和细节。设为 1 为 DLSS 5 的色彩；高于 1 会加强其色彩变化。"

msgid "Highlight guard"
msgstr "高光保护"

msgid "Limits how far DLSS 5 may brighten a pixel, as a multiple of its original brightness, so lights do not turn into bright speckles."
msgstr "限制 DLSS 5 能将像素提亮多少（以原始亮度的倍数计），避免灯光变成亮斑。"

msgid "Brightening limit"
msgstr "提亮上限"

msgid "Dark halo reduction"
msgstr "暗光晕抑制"

msgid "Removes thin dark outlines DLSS 5 adds beside bright edges and keeps its broad lighting change. Can lighten real shadow edges."
msgstr "去除 DLSS 5 在亮边缘旁添加的细暗边，保留其整体光照变化。可能会提亮真实的阴影边缘。"

msgid "Bright halo reduction"
msgstr "亮光晕抑制"

msgid "Removes thin bright outlines DLSS 5 adds beside dark edges."
msgstr "去除 DLSS 5 在暗边缘旁添加的细亮边。"

msgid "Halo radius"
msgstr "光晕半径"

msgid "How far from each pixel to look for the edge, in network pixels."
msgstr "在每个像素周围多远处寻找边缘，单位为网络像素。"

msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "缩放"

msgid "Signed PQ"
msgstr "有符号 PQ"

msgid "Linear"
msgstr "线性"

msgid "Scaling Domain"
msgstr "缩放域"

msgid "Signal space used for downsampling and upsampling."
msgstr "降采样和升采样所用的信号空间。"

msgid "Area"
msgstr "区域"

msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "双线性"

msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "最近邻"

msgid "Downsample Filter"
msgstr "降采样滤波"

msgid "Bicubic"
msgstr "双三次"

msgid "Edge-aware"
msgstr "边缘感知"

msgid "Upsample Filter"
msgstr "升采样滤波"

msgid "Resolution Scale below 100: how the network's change is enlarged. Edge-aware keeps it from bleeding across edges."
msgstr "分辨率比例低于 100 时：网络改动的放大方式。边缘感知可防止改动越过边缘扩散。"

msgid "Supersampling Filter"
msgstr "超采样滤波"

msgid "Resolution Scale above 100: how the network's larger image comes back to the game's size. Area averages every pixel it covers, without aliasing."
msgstr "分辨率比例高于 100 时：网络的较大画面如何缩回游戏尺寸。区域会平均其覆盖的每个像素，不产生锯齿。"

msgid "RGB residual"
msgstr "RGB 残差"

msgid "Processed image"
msgstr "处理后图像"

msgid "Scale Reconstruction"
msgstr "缩放重建"

msgid ""
"RGB residual adds the network's change to the full-resolution image.\n"
"Processed image uses the upscaled network output directly."
msgstr ""
"RGB 残差将网络的改动加到全分辨率图像上。\n"
"处理后图像直接使用放大后的网络输出。"

msgid "HDR"
msgstr "HDR"

msgid "Linear BT.709"
msgstr "线性 BT.709"

msgid "Encoding"
msgstr "编码"

msgid ""
"Auto treats the DLSS input and output as linear BT.709 and follows the swapchain format and color space at Present.\n"
"Other choices override the encoding of the processed image."
msgstr ""
"自动：将 DLSS 输入和输出视为线性 BT.709；在呈现阶段则跟随交换链的格式和色彩空间。\n"
"其他选项会覆盖所处理图像的编码。"

msgid "PQ SDR"
msgstr "PQ SDR"

msgid "Linear SDR"
msgstr "线性 SDR"

msgid "NR Signal Encoding"
msgstr "NR 信号编码"

msgid "Encoding supplied to the network after the HDR-to-SDR bridge."
msgstr "HDR 转 SDR 桥接之后提供给网络的编码。"

msgid "Diffuse White"
msgstr "漫反射白"

msgid "%.0f nits"
msgstr "%.0f 尼特"

msgid "Reference white of the HDR-to-SDR bridge. Encoding Auto selects it; choose an explicit encoding to set it."
msgstr "HDR 转 SDR 桥接的参考白。编码为自动时自动选择；选择明确的编码后可手动设置。"

msgid "Highlight roll-off"
msgstr "高光压缩"

msgid "HDR only: up to this share of diffuse white the network sees the image unchanged; brighter values are compressed into the rest. Lower gives highlights more room."
msgstr "仅限 HDR：在漫反射白的这一比例以内，网络看到的画面不变；更亮的值被压缩到剩余范围内。数值越低，高光空间越大。"

msgid "Exposure"
msgstr "曝光"

msgid "Multiplies the exposure used for neural rendering, independent of the game's exposure."
msgstr "倍增神经渲染所用的曝光，与游戏自身的曝光无关。"

msgid "On"
msgstr "开启"

msgid "Inverse"
msgstr "反向"

msgid "Use Exposure Value"
msgstr "使用曝光值"

msgid "On applies the game's DLSS exposure texture before neural rendering; Inverse divides by it."
msgstr "开启：在神经渲染前应用游戏的 DLSS 曝光纹理；反向：除以该值。"

msgid "Adaptive exposure"
msgstr "自适应曝光"

msgid ""
"Keeps the scene the network sees at a steady brightness in HDR games, so the same settings suit games with different exposure.\n"
"The game's own brightness is unchanged. SDR color is left as it is."
msgstr ""
"在 HDR 游戏中让网络看到的画面保持稳定亮度，使同一套设置适用于曝光不同的游戏。\n"
"游戏本身的亮度不会改变。SDR 颜色保持原样。"

msgid "Adaptive target"
msgstr "自适应目标"

msgid "The average brightness Adaptive exposure gives the scene the network sees (0.18 is middle grey). Higher shows it a brighter scene."
msgstr "自适应曝光为网络所见场景设定的平均亮度（中灰为 0.18）。数值越高，网络看到的场景越亮。"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "提供程序"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快速"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

msgid "UI Correction"
msgstr "UI 校正"

msgid ""
"Auto enables the provider's UI correction at Present, whose image contains the game's UI, and leaves it off for DLSS input and output.\n"
"Off never uses it. On always does."
msgstr ""
"自动：在呈现阶段（其图像包含游戏 UI）启用提供程序的 UI 校正，对 DLSS 输入和输出则保持关闭。\n"
"关闭：从不使用。开启：始终使用。"

msgid "Strict"
msgstr "严格"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "正常"

msgid "Loose"
msgstr "宽松"

msgid "Motion tolerance"
msgstr "运动容差"

msgid ""
"How much a surface may change between frames and still keep the carried fine detail.\n"
"Strict carries it on fewer moving surfaces, which keep the rebuilt look; Loose carries more detail."
msgstr ""
"表面在帧间可以变化多少仍保留沿用的细节。\n"
"严格会在更少的运动表面上沿用细节，这些表面保留重建的效果；宽松会沿用更多细节。"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "从不"

msgid "Optional"
msgstr "可选"

msgid "Required"
msgstr "必需"

msgid "Use DLSS resources"
msgstr "使用 DLSS 资源"

msgid ""
"Present only. Optional reuses the DLSS motion vectors and depth when available, otherwise neutral inputs.\n"
"Required skips Present processing without them. Never always uses neutral inputs."
msgstr ""
"仅用于呈现。可选：有 DLSS 运动矢量和深度时复用它们，否则使用中性输入。\n"
"必需：没有它们时跳过呈现处理。从不：始终使用中性输入。"

msgid "Block Hudless"
msgstr "阻止无 HUD 图像"

msgid "Present only: keeps the game's HUD-less image from DLSS frame generation, so generated frames match processed ones."
msgstr "仅用于呈现：不让 DLSS 帧生成使用游戏的无 HUD 图像，使生成帧与处理后的帧一致。"

msgid "Mask"
msgstr "遮罩"

msgid "Network input"
msgstr "网络输入"

msgid "Network output"
msgstr "网络输出"

msgid "Change (x8)"
msgstr "改动 (x8)"

msgid "Debug view"
msgstr "调试视图"

msgid ""
"Shows what the network is given and returns, or where DLSS 5 changes the image (grey: unchanged; lighter or darker: changed).\n"
"With Split view, on the DLSS 5 side only."
msgstr ""
"显示网络接收和返回的内容，或 DLSS 5 改动画面的位置（灰色：未改动；更亮或更暗：已改动）。\n"
"分屏对比时，仅在 DLSS 5 一侧显示。"

msgid "Swap sides"
msgstr "交换两侧"

msgid "Split view shows DLSS 5 on the left and the original on the right."
msgstr "分屏对比时左侧显示 DLSS 5，右侧显示原始画面。"

msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "恢复默认值"

msgid "Waiting for the game's Reflex plugin."
msgstr "正在等待游戏的 Reflex 插件。"

msgid "The loaded Reflex plugin version is unsupported."
msgstr "已加载的 Reflex 插件版本不受支持。"

msgid "Reflex controls are unavailable for this plugin."
msgstr "此插件不支持 Reflex 控制。"

msgid "The Reflex limit is unavailable for the current FG runtime."
msgstr "当前帧生成运行时无法使用 Reflex 帧率限制。"

msgid "Waiting for game Reflex settings. Change the game's Reflex setting once to retry."
msgstr "正在等待游戏的 Reflex 设置。请在游戏中更改一次 Reflex 设置以重试。"

msgid "Waiting for the game's Reflex settings thread."
msgstr "正在等待游戏的 Reflex 设置线程。"

msgid "Waiting for Reflex availability."
msgstr "正在检查 Reflex 是否可用。"

msgid "Reflex is unavailable."
msgstr "Reflex 不可用。"

msgid "Restoring the game's Reflex limit..."
msgstr "正在恢复游戏的 Reflex 帧率限制…"

msgid "The game rejected the Reflex limit."
msgstr "游戏拒绝了 Reflex 帧率限制。"

msgid "The game's Reflex settings cannot be safely replayed."
msgstr "无法安全地重新应用游戏的 Reflex 设置。"

msgid "The Reflex plugin changed. Restart the game."
msgstr "Reflex 插件已更改。请重启游戏。"

msgid "Waiting for the next safe Reflex update."
msgstr "正在等待下一个可安全更新 Reflex 的时机。"

msgid "Waiting for the game to accept the Reflex limit."
msgstr "正在等待游戏接受 Reflex 帧率限制。"

msgid "Game"
msgstr "游戏"

msgid "V-Sync"
msgstr "垂直同步"

msgid ""
"Off submits the game's frames without V-Sync.\n"
"NVIDIA Control Panel V-Sync settings take priority."
msgstr ""
"“关闭”会在不开启垂直同步的情况下输出游戏画面。\n"
"NVIDIA 控制面板中的垂直同步设置优先。"

msgid "Reflex FPS limit"
msgstr "Reflex 帧率限制"

msgid ""
"Caps the frame rate XeMFG presents.\n"
"XeLL paces the game's frames to it."
msgstr ""
"限制 XeMFG 输出的帧率。\n"
"XeLL 会据此调节游戏帧的节奏。"

msgid ""
"Caps the game's frame rate through Reflex.\n"
"Paused while Dynamic MFG is on; the saved limit is kept."
msgstr ""
"通过 Reflex 限制游戏帧率。\n"
"开启动态 MFG 时暂停；已保存的限制会保留。"

msgid "The Reflex limit is paused while Dynamic MFG is on. The saved limit is kept."
msgstr "开启动态 MFG 时，Reflex 帧率限制暂停。已保存的限制会保留。"

msgid "The presentation settings could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存显示设置。"

msgid "Off not applied"
msgstr "关闭未生效"

msgid "applies when the game recreates its swapchain"
msgstr "游戏重新创建交换链后生效"

msgid "the game already presents without V-Sync"
msgstr "游戏本身已关闭垂直同步"

msgid "Off requested"
msgstr "已请求关闭"

msgid "not available on this GPU or driver"
msgstr "此 GPU 或驱动程序不支持"

msgid "game interval %u submitted as 0"
msgstr "游戏同步间隔 %u 已改为 0"

msgid "the game's last Present was not accepted"
msgstr "游戏最近一次 Present 未被接受"

msgid "waiting for the game's swapchain"
msgstr "正在等待游戏的交换链"

msgid "Applying..."
msgstr "正在应用…"

msgid "Reflex limit"
msgstr "Reflex 限制"

msgid "applied by XeLL to XeMFG's output"
msgstr "由 XeLL 应用于 XeMFG 的输出"

msgid "%d FPS requested"
msgstr "已请求 %d FPS"

msgid "applies with XeMFG's next frame"
msgstr "将在 XeMFG 的下一帧生效"

msgid "accepted"
msgstr "已接受"

msgid "restoring the game's Reflex limit"
msgstr "正在恢复游戏的 Reflex 帧率限制"

msgid "paused for Dynamic MFG"
msgstr "因动态 MFG 暂停"

msgid "Reflex status is temporarily unavailable."
msgstr "Reflex 状态暂时不可用。"

msgid "Path traced hair"
msgstr "路径追踪毛发"

msgid "Preparing"
msgstr "正在准备"

msgid "Active"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "universal: game RTX hair converted"
msgstr "通用：已转换游戏的 RTX 毛发"

msgid "no hair built in the last 2 s"
msgstr "最近 2 秒未构建毛发"

msgid "Ready"
msgstr "就绪"

msgid "waiting for game hair"
msgstr "正在等待游戏毛发"

msgid "Universal hair runs the game's own RTX 50 hair on this GPU. It is on by default; set Universal=0 under [RtxHair] in RTXMFG.RtxHair.ini beside the game to turn it off."
msgstr "通用毛发会在此 GPU 上运行游戏自带的 RTX 50 毛发。默认开启；在游戏旁 RTXMFG.RtxHair.ini 的 [RtxHair] 下设置 Universal=0 即可关闭。"

msgid "%s updates"
msgstr "%s 次更新"

msgid "Builds"
msgstr "构建"

msgid "%s not converted"
msgstr "%s 个未转换"

msgid "Hair shaders"
msgstr "毛发着色器"

msgid "Hair diagnostics"
msgstr "毛发诊断"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "Waiting for early device"
msgstr "正在等待设备初始化"

msgid "Unsupported game build"
msgstr "不支持的游戏版本"

msgid "Unsupported GPU"
msgstr "不支持的 GPU"

msgid "Native LSS"
msgstr "原生 LSS"

msgid "Unsupported driver"
msgstr "不支持的驱动"

msgid "game Path Traced Hair setting"
msgstr "游戏的路径追踪毛发设置"

msgid "tracing converted hair"
msgstr "正在追踪转换后的毛发"

msgid "no hair traced in the last 2 s"
msgstr "最近 2 秒未追踪毛发"

msgid "Turn it on or off with HairWorks and Path Traced Hair in the game's graphics settings."
msgstr "在游戏图形设置中通过 HairWorks 和“路径追踪毛发”开启或关闭。"

msgid "Traced hair"
msgstr "已追踪毛发"

msgid "Turn on frame generation in the game's settings (DLSS or XeSS)."
msgstr "请在游戏设置中开启帧生成（DLSS 或 XeSS）。"

msgid "Turn on frame generation in the game's settings (DLSS)."
msgstr "请在游戏设置中开启帧生成（DLSS）。"

msgid "Turn on frame generation in the game's settings (XeSS)."
msgstr "请在游戏设置中开启帧生成（XeSS）。"

msgid "Turn on DLSS or XeSS frame generation in the game's settings. If the game has none, turn on XeMFG standalone."
msgstr "请在游戏设置中开启 DLSS 或 XeSS 帧生成。如果游戏没有该选项，请开启“独立 XeMFG”。"

msgid "Turn on DLSS or XeSS frame generation in the game's settings."
msgstr "请在游戏设置中开启 DLSS 或 XeSS 帧生成。"

msgid "Game FG"
msgstr "游戏帧生成"

msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

msgid "Waiting for a supported game GPU"
msgstr "正在等待游戏使用受支持的 GPU"

msgid "Game FG option"
msgstr "游戏帧生成选项"

msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "解锁"

msgid ""
"For games that hide DLSS Frame Generation on RTX 30 cards, such as Wuthering Waves.\n"
"The game then sees an NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090. DLSS, Streamline, the driver and MFG Unlocker\n"
"keep using your real GPU. The game's recommended settings may assume an RTX 4090.\n"
"Online games with anti cheat may treat any mod as a risk. Applies after a game restart."
msgstr ""
"适用于在 RTX 30 显卡上隐藏 DLSS 帧生成选项的游戏，例如《鸣潮》。\n"
"启用后，游戏会将显卡识别为 NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090。DLSS、Streamline、驱动程序和 MFG Unlocker\n"
"仍使用你的真实 GPU。游戏的推荐画质设置可能会按 RTX 4090 给出。\n"
"带反作弊的在线游戏可能会将任何模组视为风险。重启游戏后生效。"

msgid "The Game FG option could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存游戏帧生成选项。"

msgid "Restart the game to unlock its Frame Generation option."
msgstr "重启游戏后即可解锁帧生成选项。"

msgid "Restart the game to report your real GPU again."
msgstr "重启游戏后，游戏将重新识别你的真实 GPU。"

msgid "The Game FG option could not be applied this session. See the log."
msgstr "游戏帧生成选项未能在本次运行中应用。请查看日志。"

msgid "The game sees an NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 this session."
msgstr "本次运行中，游戏识别到的显卡为 NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090。"

msgid "This GPU is not an RTX 30 card; the game sees its real name."
msgstr "此 GPU 不是 RTX 30 显卡；游戏识别到的是其真实型号。"

msgid ""
"Writes the MFG Unlocker log beside the game. Bug reports need it.\n"
"Turn it off to stop writing the log. Applies after a game restart."
msgstr ""
"将 MFG Unlocker 日志写入游戏目录。提交错误报告时需要它。\n"
"关闭后将不再写入日志。重启游戏后生效。"

msgid "The log setting could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存日志设置。"

msgid "Restart the game to write the log again."
msgstr "重启游戏后将重新写入日志。"

msgid "Restart the game to stop writing the log."
msgstr "重启游戏后将停止写入日志。"

msgid "Write log file"
msgstr "写入日志文件"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "XeMFG standalone"
msgstr "独立 XeMFG"

msgid ""
"MFG Unlocker runs XeSS multi-frame generation itself, without OptiScaler, from the inputs of the game's DLSS frame generation or of its DLSS, XeSS or FSR 3.1 upscaling. It replaces the game's own frame generation.\n"
"Switching it on or off applies at once: MFG Unlocker briefly resizes the game's window so the game hands its swap chain over. If the game ignores that, it applies at the game's next resolution or window-mode change, or after a restart."
msgstr ""
"MFG Unlocker 自行运行 XeSS 多帧生成，无需 OptiScaler，输入来自游戏的 DLSS 帧生成，或其 DLSS、XeSS 或 FSR 3.1 超分辨率。它会取代游戏自身的帧生成。\n"
"开启或关闭会立即生效：MFG Unlocker 会短暂调整游戏窗口大小，让游戏交出其交换链。如果游戏忽略此操作，将在游戏下次更改分辨率或窗口模式时生效，或在重启后生效。"

msgid "Dynamic"
msgstr "动态"

msgid "MFG mode"
msgstr "MFG 模式"

msgid "Dynamic changes how many frames XeMFG generates every game frame, so its frame rate follows the target, up to the frames set. The target is not a limit."
msgstr "“动态”会在每个游戏帧调整 XeMFG 生成的帧数，使其帧率接近目标，最多不超过所设帧数。目标不是帧率上限。"

msgid "Up to"
msgstr "上限"

msgid "Dynamic target"
msgstr "动态目标"

msgid "Display refresh rate"
msgstr "显示器刷新率"

msgid "The FPS limit when one is set, otherwise just under the display's refresh rate."
msgstr "已设置帧率限制时为该限制，否则略低于显示器刷新率。"

msgid "Target FPS"
msgstr "目标帧率"

msgid "Closest"
msgstr "最接近"

msgid "At least"
msgstr "至少"

msgid "At most"
msgstr "至多"

msgid "Rounding"
msgstr "取整方式"

msgid "Closest: the frame rate closest to the target. At least: the fewest frames that reach it. At most: the most frames that stay under it."
msgstr "最接近：帧率最接近目标。至少：达到目标所需的最少帧数。至多：不超过目标的最多帧数。"

msgid "Allow 1X"
msgstr "允许 1X"

msgid "Lets Dynamic turn frame generation off when the game's own frames come nearest the target."
msgstr "当游戏自身帧率最接近目标时，允许“动态”关闭帧生成。"

msgid "Use target as cap"
msgstr "将目标作为上限"

msgid "Holds XeMFG's frame rate at the target with the FPS limit and uses the fewest frames that reach it, never 1X."
msgstr "用帧率限制将 XeMFG 的帧率保持在目标，并使用达到目标的最少帧数，从不使用 1X。"

msgid "The game's folder path is too long (260 characters or more) for XeMFG to search it."
msgstr "游戏文件夹路径过长（不少于 260 个字符），XeMFG 无法在其中查找。"

msgid "XeMFG needs libxess_fg.dll and libxell.dll in an RTXMFG-XeSS folder beside MFG Unlocker."
msgstr "XeMFG 需要将 libxess_fg.dll 和 libxell.dll 放在 MFG Unlocker 旁边的 RTXMFG-XeSS 文件夹中。"

msgid "XeMFG needs libxess_fg.dll and libxell.dll together in %s (or beside the game's exe in %s). Restart the game after adding them."
msgstr "XeMFG 需要将 libxess_fg.dll 和 libxell.dll 一起放在 %s 中（或游戏 exe 旁边的 %s 中）。添加后请重启游戏。"

msgid "Only libxell.dll was found."
msgstr "只找到了 libxell.dll。"

msgid "Only libxess_fg.dll was found."
msgstr "只找到了 libxess_fg.dll。"

msgid "The two files are in different folders."
msgstr "这两个文件位于不同的文件夹中。"

msgid "Found %s, not %s: check the file's name and extension."
msgstr "找到的是 %s，而不是 %s：请检查文件名和扩展名。"

msgid "The %s in %s is version %s, which is too old for XeMFG."
msgstr "%s（位于 %s）的版本为 %s，对 XeMFG 来说太旧了。"

msgid "The %s in %s is too old for XeMFG."
msgstr "%s（位于 %s）对 XeMFG 来说太旧了。"

msgid "Put libxess_fg.dll and libxell.dll from Intel's XeSS SDK %s in %s, then restart the game."
msgstr "请将 Intel XeSS SDK %s 中的 libxess_fg.dll 和 libxell.dll 放入 %s，然后重启游戏。"

msgid "Restart the game to start XeMFG."
msgstr "请重启游戏以启动 XeMFG。"

msgid "This game ignores window size changes, so XeMFG starts after a restart. From then on, XeMFG switches on and off in this game without a restart."
msgstr "此游戏会忽略窗口大小的变化，因此 XeMFG 将在重启后启动。此后在此游戏中开关 XeMFG 无需重启。"

msgid "The game did not resize its swap chain, so XeMFG has not started yet. It starts at the game's next resolution or window-mode change, or after a restart."
msgstr "游戏没有调整其交换链大小，因此 XeMFG 尚未启动。它将在游戏下次更改分辨率或窗口模式时启动，或在重启后启动。"

msgid "XeMFG cannot take over a swap chain in exclusive fullscreen. Switch the game to borderless or windowed, or restart the game."
msgstr "XeMFG 无法接管独占全屏下的交换链。请将游戏切换为无边框或窗口化，或重启游戏。"

msgid "XeMFG could not take over the running game's swap chain (%s). Restart the game to start XeMFG."
msgstr "XeMFG 无法接管正在运行的游戏的交换链（%s）。请重启游戏以启动 XeMFG。"

msgid "The XeMFG setting could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存 XeMFG 设置。"

msgid "XeMFG is off, but XeFG keeps the game's swap chain until the game's next resolution or window-mode change, or a restart."
msgstr "XeMFG 已关闭，但在游戏下次更改分辨率或窗口模式或重启之前，XeFG 仍保留游戏的交换链。"

msgid "XeMFG is off. The game's DLSS frame generation comes back after a restart: it cannot start again in this session once XeMFG has taken over its swap chain."
msgstr "XeMFG 已关闭。游戏的 DLSS 帧生成将在重启后恢复：XeMFG 接管其交换链后，本次会话中无法再次启动。"

msgid "Moving the game's swap chain to XeMFG..."
msgstr "正在将游戏的交换链移交给 XeMFG..."

msgid "XeMFG could not start: %s"
msgstr "XeMFG 无法启动：%s"

msgid "Turn on DLSS frame generation in the game's settings. XeMFG replaces it."
msgstr "请在游戏设置中开启 DLSS 帧生成，XeMFG 会取代它。"

msgid "Turn off the game's FSR frame generation. XeMFG does not run on top of it."
msgstr "请关闭游戏的 FSR 帧生成，XeMFG 不会叠加在其上运行。"

msgid "The game's motion vectors are at display resolution. XeMFG cannot use them yet."
msgstr "游戏的运动矢量为显示分辨率，XeMFG 暂时无法使用。"

msgid "Waiting for the game's DLSS, XeSS or FSR 3.1 upscaling, or its DLSS frame generation."
msgstr "正在等待游戏的 DLSS、XeSS 或 FSR 3.1 超分辨率，或其 DLSS 帧生成。"

